<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on Novartis.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on Novartis.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 7.5 million American-style call warrants, on Novartis, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>50 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,750.00 CHF	    PREMIUM	9.20 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.92 CHF		  GEARING	17.6 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   19.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	21.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT ONE</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,690.00 CHF</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
